  "name": "Slow Cooker Baked Beans",
  "subtitle": "Sweet, smoky beans with ham and vegetables",
  "description": "Canned beans simmer with barbecue sauce, ketchup, brown sugar, mustard, vegetables, and cooked ham until thickened.",
